flowchart TD
  A[Entry surface] --> B[Review context]
  B --> C{Input required?}
  C -- No --> D[View result]
  C -- Yes --> E[Enter or select value]
  E --> F{Valid?}
  F -- No --> G[Show inline guidance]
  G --> E
  F -- Yes --> H[Confirm action]
  H --> I{Complete?}
  I -- Yes --> J[Show success state]
  I -- No --> K[Show pending or recovery state]
  K --> L[Retry or return]
  L --> B